<!--
  The Loops tab's bottom-bar icon.

  Ported from the iOS asset
  `kornerz/Kornerz/Resources/Assets.xcassets/Images/Home/tab_loops.imageset/
  tab_loops.svg` — the stroked opposing loop arrows that replace the
  `Icons.Filled.PlayCircle` placeholder.

  The stroke colour is the iOS asset's own `#2E2F3E` (the Kornerz
  `CharcoalLight` token). `Icon` tints a painter with the ambient
  content colour, so the selected / unselected states follow the
  bottom bar's own palette.
-->
